      "TechnicalDescription": "Joins ConversationDetailArtifacts, ArtifactVersions, and Artifacts tables to return basic artifact metadata for a conversation. Returns display-ready data (name, type, version number) without expensive Content field. Supports lazy-loading pattern where full entities are loaded on-demand when user clicks on an artifact. Single query replaces 3 separate sequential queries for ~70% performance improvement.",
